#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced techniques - Qiskit addons {#advanced-techniques-qiskit-addons}"
msgstr "Advanced techniques - Mga Qiskit addon {#advanced-techniques-qiskit-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit addons are a collection of research capabilities for enabling algorithm discovery at the utility scale. These modular software components build on Qiskit’s performant foundation and can plug into a [workflow](/guides/intro-to-patterns) to scale or design new quantum algorithms. This page highlights the available tools across key functional categories to help you choose relevant capabilities when building your workflows.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga Qiskit addon ay koleksyon ng mga research capabilities para sa pagtuklas ng mga algorithm sa utility scale. Ang mga modular na software component na ito ay nagtitiwala sa matibay na pundasyon ng Qiskit at maaaring isaksak sa isang [workflow](/guides/intro-to-patterns) para mapalawak o magdisenyo ng mga bagong quantum algorithm. Itinatampok ng page na ito ang mga available na tools sa mga pangunahing functional na kategorya para matulungan kang pumili ng mga kaugnay na kakayahan habang binubuo ang iyong mga workflow.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map domain problems {#map-domain-problems}"
msgstr "I-map ang mga domain problem {#map-domain-problems}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These capabilities specialize in mapping domain problems into quantum operators and circuits for execution on a quantum computer.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      description=\"Model optimization problems and map them into representations that can be understood by a quantum computer.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga kakayahang ito ay espesyalista sa pag-map ng mga domain problem sa mga quantum operator at circuit para sa pagpapatupad sa isang quantum computer.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      description=\"I-model ang mga optimization problem at i-map ang mga ito sa mga representasyong naiintindihan ng quantum computer.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      description=\"Model fermionic quantum systems and map them to qubit operators and circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-fermions/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      description=\"I-model ang mga fermionic quantum system at i-map ang mga ito sa mga qubit operator at circuit.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-fermions/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      description=\"Construct high-fidelity circuits with reduced depth using approximate quantum compilation with tensor networks.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      description=\"Bumuo ng mga high-fidelity na circuit na may mas mababang depth gamit ang approximate quantum compilation with tensor networks.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Multi-product formulas\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce the Trotter error of Hamiltonian dynamics through a weighted combination of several circuit executions.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mpf/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: MPF\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Multi-product formulas\"\n"
"      description=\"Bawasan ang Trotter error ng Hamiltonian dynamics sa pamamagitan ng weighted na kumbinasyon ng ilang circuit execution.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mpf/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: MPF\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr "</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optimize circuits for hardware execution {#optimize-circuits-for-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "I-optimize ang mga circuit para sa hardware execution {#optimize-circuits-for-hardware-execution}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These capabilities are useful for reducing circuit depth and typically come with an increased sampling overhead.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Operator backpropagation\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce circuit depth in expectation value estimations by backpropagating observables through the circuit.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-obp\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: OBP\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga kakayahang ito ay kapaki-pakinabang para mabawasan ang circuit depth at karaniwang may kasamang mas mataas na sampling overhead.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Operator backpropagation\"\n"
"      description=\"Bawasan ang circuit depth sa mga expectation value estimation sa pamamagitan ng pagbabalik-propagasyon ng mga observable sa buong circuit.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-obp\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: OBP\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce the depth of transpiled circuits by decomposing entangling gates between non-adjacent qubits.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-cutting\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      description=\"Bawasan ang depth ng mga na-transpile na circuit sa pamamagitan ng pag-decompose ng mga entangling gate sa pagitan ng mga hindi magkaratig na qubit.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-cutting\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage noise for expectation value estimation {#manage-noise-for-expectation-value-estimation}"
msgstr "Pamahalaan ang noise para sa expectation value estimation {#manage-noise-for-expectation-value-estimation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the following addons to manage noise when building quantum workloads that estimate expectation values of observables.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang mga sumusunod na addon para pamahalaan ang noise habang binubuo ang mga quantum workload na nag-eestimate ng mga expectation value ng mga observable.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Propagated noise absorption\"\n"
"      description=\"Mitigate expectation values by measuring a target observable that has absorbed noise model information.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-pna\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PNA\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Shaded lightcones\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) sampling overhead by removing noise model terms that have low impact on the observable estimation.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-slc\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SLC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Propagated noise absorption\"\n"
"      description=\"I-mitigate ang mga expectation value sa pamamagitan ng pagsukat ng target observable na may naisama na impormasyon ng noise model.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-pna\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PNA\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Shaded lightcones\"\n"
"      description=\"Bawasan ang probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) sampling overhead sa pamamagitan ng pag-alis ng mga noise model term na may mababang epekto sa observable estimation.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-slc\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SLC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage noise for sampling results {#manage-noise-for-sampling-results}"
msgstr "Pamahalaan ang noise para sa mga sampling result {#manage-noise-for-sampling-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These techniques are useful for managing noise on sampling results.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga technique na ito ay kapaki-pakinabang para pamahalaan ang noise sa mga sampling result.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<CardGroup>\n"
msgstr "<CardGroup>\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sample-based quantum diagonalization\"\n"
"      description=\"Estimate the spectrum of quantum Hamiltonians by processing noisy samples and diagonalizing in a reduced subspace.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Overview\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sample-based quantum diagonalization\"\n"
"      description=\"Tantiyahin ang spectrum ng mga quantum Hamiltonian sa pamamagitan ng pagproseso ng mga maingay na sample at pag-diagonalize sa isang pinababang subspace.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Overview\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      description=\"An HPC-ready implementation of the SQD addon, written in modern C++17 standards and designed to enable HPC workflows and applications.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd-hpc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      description=\"Isang HPC-ready na implementasyon ng SQD addon, nakasulat sa modernong C++17 standards at dinisenyo para paganahin ang mga HPC workflow at application.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd-hpc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

